  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "On San Cha mountain, Fang Yuan forces Fei Li to hand over Expend Strength Gu before killing him. Fei Li is a rank four middle stage strength path Gu Master; the Gu is his vital Gu and core Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          341
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "char_fei_li",
          "sys_gu_master",
          "sys_vital_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "His second aperture still holds rank four Expend Strength Gu among other strength path Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          504
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-aperture-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "That Southern Border copy remains under Northern Plains region suppression with rank four Bitter Strength Gu and Charging Crash Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          516
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "second-aperture-stock",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "reg_southern_border",
          "reg_northern_plains",
          "gu_bitter_strength_gu",
          "gu_charging_crash_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Advancing bitter strength Gu, Expend Strength Gu, and charging crash Gu to rank five would be a huge project needing large amounts of materials and Gu worms. The Gu is used for restricting the strength path and has few applications. When Hei tribe goods have no expend strength Gu for purchase, he accepts that gap.",
        "chapters": [
          517
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "raising-toward-rank-five",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "path_strength",
          "fac_hei_tribe"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Hei Lou Lan activates Expend Strength Immortal Gu from her immortal aperture. That Gu is rank seven and was lent to her by Longevity Heaven in secret. She also holds a killer move that uses Expend Strength Immortal Gu as the core, called seventy-percent expended strength. After the move hits, every action or killer move of the target takes much more effort, by at least more than fifty percent.",
        "chapters": [
          2214
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "immortal-gu",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_hei_lou_lan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "fac_longevity_heaven"
        ]
      }
    ]
